# Veda Technologies – Day 3 Sales Dashboard

## Project
An interactive Power BI dashboard exploring retail sales by product category, region, and time period.

## Dashboard features
- Total Sales and Total Profit KPI cards
- Sales by Category and Sales by Region charts
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Region and Order Date slicers

## Dataset
Sample Superstore dataset from Kaggle: https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/vivek468/superstore-dataset-final

## Tools
- Microsoft Power BI Desktop
- Power Query
- DAX

